---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /gallery/
title: 活動照片庫｜東津代天府靈帝殿
description: 東津代天府靈帝殿歷年遶境、祭典、法會活動照片，依年份與分類整理。
firebase: true
extraCss:
  - gallery.css
extraJs:
  - gallery.js
---

<section class="page-head" data-glyph="影" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">影像紀錄</div>
    <h2 class="title">歷年遶境／活動照片庫</h2>
    <p class="lede">依年份與分類保存遶境、祭典與廟會活動照片。管理員登入後可上傳、刪除自行新增的照片；標註「內建」的常設照片不會出現刪除鈕。</p>

    <div class="gallery-toolbar">
      <div>
        <div class="gt-label">年份</div>
        <select id="yearSelect"></select>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-only block">
        <div class="gt-label">新增年份</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
          <input type="text" id="newYearInput" placeholder="例如 2027" style="width:100px;">
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="addYearBtn">新增</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-only block">
        <div class="gt-label">上傳分類</div>
        <select id="uploadCatSelect"></select>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-only flex" style="margin-left:auto;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;">
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="uploadBtn">＋ 上傳照片</button>
        <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept="image/*" multiple hidden>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-status guest-only" style="font-family:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;margin-left:auto;">訪客瀏覽模式，僅管理員可新增／刪除照片</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cat-bar" id="catBar"></div>
    <div class="gallery-status" id="galleryStatus">載入中…</div>
    <div class="photo-grid" id="photoGrid"></div>
    <div class="empty-state" id="emptyState" style="display:none;">這個條件下還沒有照片。</div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  window.__GALLERY_SEED__ = {{ gallery | dump | safe }};
  window.__CLOUDINARY__ = {{ site.cloudinary | dump | safe }};
</script>
